### Crash Recovery: run the agent under an ID you own
### Start the app first: diagrid dev run -f dev-crash-test.yaml --approve
### "kill_after_seconds": 8 makes the app halt itself 8s into checkIncidentStatus,
### so you do not need the kill request below. Restarting the app is what recovers
### the run; send this exact request again only to read back its answer, because
### the crash killed the connection that was waiting for one.
### Remove "kill_after_seconds" (and use a new id) to crash the app yourself with
### the request below while checkIncidentStatus runs (~10s).
POST http://localhost:8001/crash/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "inc-4471",
    "prompt": "What is the status of incident INC-4471?",
    "kill_after_seconds": 8
}

### Crash Recovery: kill the app while the run above is in flight
POST http://localhost:8001/crash/kill
